                                "commandKey 已以不同参数使用: " + commandKey);
                    }
                    return new StoredResponse(row.responseStatus(), row.responseBody());
                }
                StoredResponse response;
                try {
                    response = action.get();
                } catch (ApiException e) {
                    var won = repo.findCommand(type, commandKey);
                    if (won.isEmpty()) {
